id: insta-kill
name: Insta-Kill
type: standard
actionCost: 2
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
# A Minion targeted, or a Buddy picked - a Buddy is an Item, not a token to target (villainous.mjs).
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/encounter
exploitable: All adjacent Opponents.
source: Villainous Maneuver
# A Villainous Maneuver (the Adversaries page): "a form of Special Maneuver that all Adversaries have access to" - every
# Adversary's, given with its sheet and on the Maneuvers tab's Villainous tab; what it does, villainous.mjs.
special: true
description: >
  You eliminate one of those pesky weaklings that stands before you with nary a thought.
text: >
  Insta-Kill [1/Encounter]: You eliminate one of those pesky weaklings that stands before you with nary a thought.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 2 Actions
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Exploitable: All Adjacent Opponents. If you take Damage from an Attacking Maneuver made through the Exploit Maneuver in response to this Attacking Maneuver, the Maneuver fails.
  –Effect: Target a Minion (except a Special Minion that is not a Duplicate Minion) or Buddy. That Minion or Buddy dies.

---

# Said, not done (the user's): the Minion or Buddy dies at the table's word (villainous.mjs).
